        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="transport systems" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Representatives of this class are for example: tractor, transporter or two-axle mower. Calculations were made based on a tractor of 3000 kg, with a useful life of 7000 hours and a repair factor of 0.74. For exact results, module should only be used if lifetime and repair factor of the balanced machinery are within a narrow range of the values the module is based on. The functional unit is 1kg tractor during its lifetime.;&#10;UUID: aef9ae52-826f-3b23-b03b-153a98e74754" includedProcesses="The inventory takes into account the use of resources and the amount of emissions during the production, the maintenance and repair and the disposal of agricultural vehicles. Not taken into account were the impacts caused by fuel consumption during operation-time of the machinery, and the amount of emission from the tyre abrasion during this time. No data was available about buildings needed for manufacture and maintenance of the machinery. The routes needed for transport from manufacturer place to the farm and from here to disposal place of the waste, are balanced in the utilised transport modules." infrastructureProcess="true" localCategory="transport systems" localName="Tractor, production" localSubCategory="road\operations\infrastructure" name="Tractor, production" subCategory="road\operations\infrastructure" unit="kg"/>
